  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced.\n• Finely chop or crush garlic. In a medium saucepan, melt the butter with a dash of olive oil over medium heat.\n• Cook garlic until fragrant, 1-2 mins. Add jasmine rice, the water and a generous pinch of salt, stir, then bring to the boil.\n• Reduce heat to low and cover with a lid.\n• Cook for 10 mins, then remove from heat and keep covered until rice is tender and water is absorbed, 10 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69b0fdaa3ccf11472438fa8a/step-47252900.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Cut pumpkin into wedges.\n• Place pumpkin on the lined oven tray.\n• Sprinkle with sweet soy seasoning and drizzle with olive oil.\n• Toss to coat, then spread out in a single layer and roast until tender, 20-25 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69b0fdaa3ccf11472438fa8a/step-d13b6510.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While pumpkin is roasting, trim green beans. Roughly chop Asian greens.\n• In a small bowl, combine sriracha (SPICY! Use less if preferred), sesame dressing and the soy sauce.\n• When pumpkin has 5 mins remaining, in a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• Stir-fry green beans until softened, 4-5 mins. Add Asian greens and sesame seeds and stir-fry until wilted, 1 min. Season to taste with salt and pepper.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69b0fdaa3ccf11472438fa8a/step-c7634820.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide garlic rice and sesame greens between bowls.\n• Top with roasted soy pumpkin.\n• Drizzle with sriracha dressing and sprinkle with crispy shallots to serve.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69b0fdaa3ccf11472438fa8a/step-b4793830.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
